scripts.translation:
{0}
我是{1}，这座要塞的守卫。
目前，这里一切平静。

scripts.text:
{0}
Do you have any questions
about this stronghold?

{0}
Greetings, {1}.
What are your orders?

scripts.translation:
{0}
你好，{1}。
你有什么命令？

{0}
你已经命令我
召唤守卫来防御要塞了。

scripts.text:
{0}
I'll be standing by,
awaiting your orders.

scripts.translation:
{0}
我会待命，
等待你的命令。

scripts.text:
{0}
Who are you? Scoundrel!
Leave this stronghold now!

scripts.translation:
{0}
你是谁？无赖！
立刻离开这座要塞！
